ext-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 圣枪•朗基努斯.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3e/ounhzgxoov7lkpqellkedy6dldmbe8l.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%9C%A3%E6%9E%AA%E2%80%A2%E6%9C%97%E5%9F%BA%E5%8A%AA%E6%96%AF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3e/ounhzgxoov7lkpqellkedy6dldmbe8l.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%9C%A3%E6%9E%AA%E2%80%A2%E6%9C%97%E5%9F%BA%E5%8A%AA%E6%96%AF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3e/ounhzgxoov7lkpqellkedy6dldmbe8l.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />圣枪•朗基努斯\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>2-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓4-↑4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）对目标[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">空地</span>]范围<font color=\"red\">2</font>格内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"red\">80%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">范围伤害</span>]，召唤[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"旗帜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">旗帜</font></span></span>]，但自身失去[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"扬旗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">扬旗</font></span></span>]光环。自身没有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"扬旗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">扬旗</font></span></span>]光环时，技能变更为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"圣枪技•扬旗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">圣枪技•扬旗</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 2-3 2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7a/davtpqsgzwf7664p05po76sg00djnhx.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_2-3_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7a/davtpqsgzwf7664p05po76sg00djnhx.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%AD%8C%E6%B4%9B%E8%8E%89%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"角色图鉴库/歌洛莉亚\"><img alt=\"头像 歌洛莉亚.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/70/4l82woi612uwz8xhj71bfxuxj1ij2hv.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">歌洛莉亚</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-cont